## Cloud Training (RunPod)

```bash
# Conectar
ssh root@IP -p PORT

# Lanzar con screen
cd /workspace/PAMPAr-Coder
screen -S train
python3 cloud/runpod/train_cloud.py --config 1_5B > training.log 2>&1

# Monitorear
tail -f training.log
nvidia-smi -l 5
```

| Config | Params | VRAM | GPU |
|--------|--------|------|-----|
| 1.5B | ~230M | 8GB | A5000 |
| 3B | ~3B | 24GB | A40/A100 |

